  "description": "A compile-time, AOT/trim-safe Avalonia ViewLocator. A Roslyn source generator pairs each FooViewModel with its FooView by naming convention (same namespace, a ViewModels/Views split, or an assembly-wide search) — with a [View] override — and resolves the view from System.IServiceProvider, with no reflection and no hand-maintained map. Mark a partial class with [GenerateViewLocator] and the IDataTemplate is generated for you.",
